  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 3,000eb (Luxury)</p>\n<p><em>A specialized variant of Kiroshi’s T.O.P., the fittingly nicknamed ‘A-TOP’ has superior optics and proprietary flight guidance software.</em></p>\n<p>SP12 Head Armor with no Armor Penalty. Has built-in Anti-Smog Breathing Mask, Flashlight, Radio Communicator, and TUp (+1 Slot) Smart Glasses (w/ Anti-Dazzle, Image Enhance, and TeleOptics). The helmet’s visor may be raised or lowered without an Action. While lowered, the user’s face is completely obscured and they gain access to cybereye options installed into the Smart Glasses. While worn (and with the visor lowered) by a user with Pilot Air Vehicle Skill Level 7 or higher, or Moto Rank 2 or higher, this helmet’s custom software provides a +2 bonus to Pilot Air Vehicle Skill Checks.</p>\n<p><strong>Covers:</strong> Head<br>\n<strong>SP:</strong> 12<br>\n<strong>Armor Penalty:</strong> none</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Armor &amp; Fashion &gt; Armor Catalog).</em></p>"
